# LF line endings for every text file, on every computer. This overrides each person's core.autocrlf setting, so
# Git for Windows can't check bash scripts out with CRLF endings, which break them ("bash\r").
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

# Binary files: never convert or diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.wasm binary
*.woff2 binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
